{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYVQHFG5ZM7YX1ZYPC7XZ1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 3rdシングルミート＆グリート\n 本日で個別トーク会の全日程が終了いたしました!\n \n 会いに来てくださった皆さん、\n 本当に本当にありがとうございました😭🙏🏻\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYVRNPEMBP19J443S2M18V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 沢山笑って、沢山嬉しくなって、\n ミーグリの期間でもっともっとファンの皆さんのことが大好きになったし\n \n 辛いとき、苦しいとき、\n これからもお互いの人生を支え合える存在でいたいと強く思いました。\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYVSTZ79S50YNVMJ0EPZNW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYVTWKXNBV1R8JE4PTW8XS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYVW0NHJ0TB76PJ44EZAWM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYVX1AFWMXT18PZDDHBT4E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 本当にありがとう~。             "}],"source":"archive"}